fields.value:
{{Debuffnotes
| name = Rocket Flare
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus t3r}} The {{M|True Sight}} component affects [[debuff immune]] units.
}}

 * The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*#* {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*#** Grants 1-second 250-radius [[flying vision]] while the {{M|projectile}} is traveling.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#* The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*#* {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
*#** Grants {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#var:Rocket Flare value1}} ({{Symbol|Overclocking}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Rocket Flare value1}}*{{#var:Rocket Flare basic2}}}}|agh}})-radius flying vision with a 7-second linger duration at the {{Symbol|Target|PointArea}} area-targeted location upon {{M|projectile}} impact.
*#** {{cf|talnotes}}
*#*** The {{ValueColor||True Sight|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3r}} creates a negative {{M|aura}} at the area-targeted location that grants {{M|True Sight}} within the radius.
*#*** Learning the talent immediately update all current traveling projectiles, but not exploded ones.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|rattletrap_rocket_flare_slow}}
*#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes the duration.

* The {{M|projectile}} has the following additional properties:
** Blocks {{M|neutral creep}} camps.
** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
**** Appears green to allied heroes on the minimap.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Appears red to enemy heroes on the minimap and requires {{M|vision}} over the projectile to see it.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Has the following ability effects while {{A|Clockwerk|Overclocking}}:
** [[File:Dota2 Clockwerk Overclocking Rocket Flare Visualization icon-1.png|105px|]][[File:Dota2 Clockwerk Overclocking Rocket Flare Visualization icon-2.png|105px|]]
*** Launches {{ValueColor||{{#var:Rocket Flare type2 value1 agh}}|agh}} rocket projectiles, in {{ValueColor||{{#var:Rocket Flare type2 value2 agh}}|agh}}-second intervals, horizontally toward the {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} area-targeted location [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] {{to}} location [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]] at [[File:Dota2 East.png|31px|East]] {{to}} location [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|21px|Q]] at [[File:Dota2 West.png|31px|West]] .
*** {{Code|PS {{=}} PQ {{=}} {{#expr:{{#var:Rocket Flare value1}}*{{#var:Rocket Flare type2 value3 agh}}}}}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Rocket Flare icon0}}
| desc = Fires a global range flare that explodes over a given area. Upon impact, enemies in the area take damage and are briefly slowed. Rocket flare provides vision over the impact area for 6 seconds.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
** Has {{#var:Rocket Flare basic1}}-[[projectile speed]].

* {{cf|talnotes}} Acquiring the {{ValueColor||charges|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r}} immediately grants {{ValueColor||2|25tal}} extra charge.

